DESCRIPTION:Duration: 149 mins (2h29m)\n\nFor Your Consideration Marty Mau
 ser\, a young man with a dream no one respects\, goes to hell and back in 
 pursuit of greatness. From writer/director Josh Safdie and starring Timot
 hée Chalamet\, Gwyneth Paltrow\, Odessa A'zion\, Kevin O'Leary\, Tyler Ok
 onma\, Abel Ferrara\, and Fran Drescher.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-
 and-events/for-your-consideration/marty-supreme\n\nEstimated start: 19:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
